{
  "id": "33977_nominokosu",
  "headword": "{飲|の}み{残|のこ}す",
  "reading": "のみのこす",
  "romaji": "nominokosu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to leave part of a drink",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to leave part of a drink undrunk",
      "explanation": "To stop drinking before finishing a drink, leaving some in the glass, cup or bottle. Also used of medicine not taken in full."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33977_nominokosu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦ビール→ビール：01015_biiru⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{飲|の}み{残|のこ}す。",
      "english": "To leave some of one's beer.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33977_nominokosu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{子|こ}ども⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦ジュース→ジュース：01033_juusu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{半分|はんぶん}→半分：02938_hanbun⟧{飲|の}み{残|のこ}した。",
      "english": "The child left half of the juice.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33977_nominokosu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{薬|くすり}→薬：00793_kusuri⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{飲|の}み{残|のこ}さないよう⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧、{毎食後|まいしょくご}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{飲|の}む→飲む：00322_nomu⟧ことにして⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "So as not to leave any medicine untaken, I take it after every meal.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Compound of ⟦{飲|の}む→飲む：00322_nomu⟧ and ⟦{残|のこ}す→残す：01975_nokosu⟧ \"to leave.\" The noun is {飲|の}み{残|のこ}し, the drink left over.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Transitive: the drink takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧, X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{飲|の}み{残|のこ}す\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{食|た}べ{残|のこ}す→食べ残す：33939_tabenokosu⟧: to leave food uneaten — the same pattern with food",
